e – Plaenge: \nBem-estar e Esporte: Piscina coberta e aquecida, 2 academias equipadas, quadra poliesportiva e quadra de tênis.\nSocial e Família: Salão de festas, churrasqueira, bosque privativo, wine bar, playground e espaço mulher.\nPraticidade e Segurança: Espaço office (coworking), portaria 24 horas e segurança com ronda o dia todo. \n\nLocalização Estratégica:\nSituado em uma das regiões mais nobres e arborizadas de Curitiba, o imóvel oferece a tranquilidade residencial do Ecoville com acesso rápido às principais vias da cidade. A poucos minutos do ParkShoppingBarigüi, do Parque Barigui, de supermercados, escolas de referência e com fácil deslocamento para outras regiões.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6af62d4684ec13f5f98ed51e/pilar-homes-images-watermark/41249105-8b53-4b0a-99e9-4c70b73a1cf5.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6af62d4684ec13f5f98ed51e/pilar-homes-images-watermark/2267651d-ec77-4398-a8e1-c3bb16627462.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6af62d4684ec13f5f98ed51e/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c442e9c2-d068-4d3e-99e1-2a84b5a67ef0.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6af62d4684ec13f5f98ed51e/pilar-homes-images-watermark/024a378d-0a7b-4491-b76a-4b463787137d.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6af62d4684ec13f5f98ed51e/pilar-homes-images-watermark/0dc8dae9-034b-48fe-b200-d4526ccd16cb.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6af62d4684ec13f5f98ed51e/pilar-homes-images-watermark/7bbefdad-f8fd-4a82-8ba0-8f604f6190ae.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6af62d4684ec13f5f98ed51e/pilar-homes-images-watermark/af00967d-5846-4c13-8077-d174adff2c7c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6af62d4684ec13f5f98ed51e/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f77c87b6-2661-478f-beb3-592939bb6f00.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6af62d4684ec13f5f98ed51e/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9c65c8